20:["$","p",null,{"children":["The streaming transport for blobs too large to move in a single\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"BatchUpdateBlobs"}]," or ",["$","code",null,{"children":"BatchReadBlobs"}]," call, with the ",["$","$L1c",null,{"href":"#digest","children":"digest"}],"\nencoded in the resource name. Where the batch calls stop and this one starts\nis a server limit the ",["$","$L1c",null,{"href":"#capabilities-api","children":"Capabilities API"}]," advertises."]}]
