26:["$","p",null,{"children":["An ",["$","$L1c",null,{"href":"#action-cache-ac","children":"Action Cache"}]," wrapper that checks every output\n",["$","$L1c",null,{"href":"#digest","children":"digest"}]," still exists in the CAS before serving a hit. Without it a\nCAS eviction turns old cache entries into hits that reference blobs nobody can\ndownload, and the build fails while fetching outputs instead of quietly\nmissing the cache. Valid only on AC stores."]}]
