34:["$","p",null,{"children":"A two-tier store. Reads try the fast backend, fall back to the slow one, and\ncopy what they find into the fast tier on the way back; writes mirror to both.\nIts one sharp edge: it never checks the slow tier for something the fast tier\nalready has, so a blob that reached the fast tier without reaching the slow one\nstays invisible to everything reading the slow tier directly."}]
