36:["$","p",null,{"children":["The CAS call that makes uploads incremental: the client offers a list of\n",["$","$L1c",null,{"href":"#digest","children":"digests"}],", the server returns the ones it does not have, and the\nclient uploads only those. On a warm cache this and the ",["$","$L1c",null,{"href":"#action-cache-ac","children":"AC"}],"\nlookup are most of what a client does."]}]
